2046	  // below reuses `serverRootPassword(server)` instead of minting a fresh one
2047	  // whenever `server.vmid` is already set — that reuse exists for a RETRY
2048	  // (cloud-init's password module is once-per-instance, so a retry must not
2049	  // overwrite Server.rootPasswordEnc with a value the already-booted guest
